Cell["\<\
Has the same sample-by-sample list of {energy, stateFunction[eigenvector]} \
pairs as EigenspectralData, using ParallelMap over the samples.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1732493261,ExpressionUUID->"79afc022-d33d-7c4b-a163-b1b6f8a1b197"],

Cell["\<\
The default stateFunction is Identity. Supply it explicitly before n when \
selecting a subset of eigenpairs.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1281670797,ExpressionUUID->"5c58ea60-70e4-e642-b6a2-de1d6a6c6dd0"],

Cell["\<\
Load TBMethod on subkernels and distribute user model definitions before \
evaluating the example.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1370267372,ExpressionUUID->"ed5e230d-e715-eb4c-a7a0-1eae13777a78"],

Cell["\<\
Eigensystem options are accepted and Method -> \"Direct\" is supplied \
internally.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1234941892,ExpressionUUID->"46ac7921-2c35-6248-822c-d8d2d96a433b"]
}, Closed]],

